{
  "openapi": "3.0.2",
  "info": {
    "title": "Suggested Actions API",
    "summary": "The Suggested Actions API returns recommended actions that can improve your search",
    "description": "Suggested Actions are recommendations, such as turning on a feature, that can improve the search experience of an Algolia application.\n\n## Base URLs\n\nBase URLs for the Suggested Actions API:\n\n- `https://sact.us.algolia.com`\n- `https://sact.eu.algolia.com`\n\nUse the URL that matches the region of your application.\n\n**All requests must use HTTPS.**\n\n## Authentication\n\nAdd these headers to authenticate requests:\n\n- `x-algolia-application-id`. Your Algolia application ID.\n- `x-algolia-api-key`. An API key with the necessary permissions to make the request.\n\nYou can find your application ID and API key in the [Algolia dashboard](https://dashboard.algolia.com/account/api-keys).\n\n## Response status and errors\n\nResponse bodies are JSON objects.\n\nSuccessful responses return `2xx` statuses. Client errors return `4xx` statuses. Server errors return `5xx` statuses.\nError responses have a `message` property with more information.\n\n## Version\n\nThe current version of the Suggested Actions API is version 2, indicated by the `/2/` in each endpoint's URL.\n",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://sact.{region}.algolia.com",
      "description": "The region where your Algolia application is hosted.",
      "variables": {
        "region": {
          "description": "The region where your Algolia application is hosted.",
          "enum": [
            "us",
            "eu"
          ],
          "default": "us"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "appId": [],
      "apiKey": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "suggestions",
      "x-displayName": "Suggestions",
      "description": "Retrieve, create and dismiss suggested actions for an application."
    }
  ],
